From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mecid <mecid@mecomediagroup.de>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:25:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] board: polyhex: add DEBIX Model C (i.MX93)

Add the Polyhex DEBIX Model C, based on imx93_frdm.

SPL tries the three LPDDR4X timings of the vendor U-Boot
(debix-tech/uboot-nxp-debix lf_v2023.04-L6.1.36-2.1.0-debix_model_c)
in turn: NXP EVK, JSC 2 GB and JSC 1 GB. The DDR controller gives
the DRAM size.

Console is LPUART1. EQoS and FEC use the PHYs at MDIO addresses 1
and 2. Boot uses bootstd with SD first.

Signed-off-by: Mecid <mecid@mecomediagroup.de>
